  AlertDialogTrigger,
} from "@/registry/bases/radix/ui/alert-dialog"
```

**Variations shown:**
1. Basic AlertDialog - standard confirmation
2. Small AlertDialog - compact version with `size="sm"`
3. AlertDialog with Media - includes icon placeholder
4. Small AlertDialog with Media - compact + icon
5. Destructive AlertDialog - red-themed deletion with destructive button variant
6. AlertDialog nested in Dialog - demonstrates composition

**Technical details:**
- Uses `IconPlaceholder` utility supporting Lucide, Tabler, HugeIcons, Phosphor, RemixIcon
- Destructive variant available on AlertDialogAction button
- Can nest dialogs (AlertDialog inside Dialog)
- Media styling with custom className for icons"
