### 1. **Input Component Documentation**
**URL:** https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/radix/input

**Installation:**
```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add input
```

**Import Path:**
```tsx
import { Input } from "@/components/ui/input"
```

**Component Name:** `Input`

**Key Props:**
- `disabled` - Disable the input
- `aria-invalid` - Mark as invalid state
- `required` - Mark as required
- `type` - Various input types (email, password, tel, url, search, number, date, time, file, etc.)
- `placeholder` - Placeholder text

**Related Components:**
- `Field`, `FieldLabel`, `FieldDescription` - For form context
- `InputGroup` - Add icons/text inside
- `ButtonGroup` - Attach buttons to inputs

---

### 2. **Select Component Documentation**
**URL:** https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/radix/select

**Installation:**
```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add select
```

**Import Paths:**
```javascript
import {
  Select,
  SelectContent,
  SelectGroup,
  SelectItem,
  SelectTrigger,
  SelectValue,
} from "@/components/ui/select"
```

**Component Names:**
- `Select` - Root container
- `SelectTrigger` - Button that opens menu
- `SelectValue` - Display selected value/placeholder
- `SelectContent` - Dropdown container
- `SelectGroup` - Group items together
- `SelectLabel` - Label for groups
- `SelectItem` - Individual option
- `SelectSeparator` - Visual divider

**Key Props:**
- `position="item-aligned"` (default) or `position="popper"` on SelectContent
- `aria-invalid` on SelectTrigger for error states
- `data-invalid` on Field wrapper
- `defaultValue` - Set initial selection
- `disabled` - Disable entire select or individual items

---

