## URL 1: Sidebar Component Documentation

**Installation:** `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add sidebar`

**Core Components & Hierarchy:**
- `SidebarProvider` — manages collapsible state and context
- `Sidebar` — main collapsible panel
- `SidebarHeader` — sticky top section for branding
- `SidebarContent` — scrollable content area
- `SidebarGroup` — sections with optional labels/actions
- `SidebarGroupLabel` — section titles
- `SidebarGroupContent` — group content wrapper
- `SidebarMenu/SidebarMenuItem` — navigation structure
- `SidebarMenuButton` — nav item trigger (supports `isActive`, `asChild`)
- `SidebarFooter` — sticky bottom section
- `SidebarTrigger` — toggle button
- `SidebarInset` — main content wrapper
- `SidebarInput` — search/filter input
- `SidebarRail` — resize handle

**SidebarProvider Props:**
- `defaultOpen` (boolean)
- `open` (boolean — controlled)
- `onOpenChange` (callback)

**Sidebar Props:**
- `side`: "left" | "right"
- `variant`: "sidebar" | "floating" | "inset"
- `collapsible`: "offcanvas" | "icon" | "none"

**useSidebar Hook Returns:**
- `state`, `open`, `setOpen`, `openMobile`, `setOpenMobile`, `isMobile`, `toggleSidebar()`

**Keyboard Shortcut:** cmd+b (Mac) / ctrl+b (Windows)

**Theming Variables:** `--sidebar-background`, `--sidebar-foreground`, `--sidebar-primary`, `--sidebar-accent`, `--sidebar-border`, `--sidebar-ring`

---

## URL 2: Breadcrumb Component Documentation

**Installation:** `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add breadcrumb`

**Core Imports:**
```javascript
import {
  Breadcrumb,
  BreadcrumbItem,
  BreadcrumbLink,
  BreadcrumbList,
  BreadcrumbPage,
  BreadcrumbSeparator,
  BreadcrumbEllipsis,
} from "@/components/ui/breadcrumb"
```

**Component Hierarchy:**
- `Breadcrumb` (root container)
  - `BreadcrumbList` (ordered list wrapper)
    - `BreadcrumbItem` (individual item wrapper)
      - `BreadcrumbLink` (clickable navigation link, supports `asChild`)
    - `BreadcrumbSeparator` (divider between items, supports custom `children`)
    - `BreadcrumbPage` (current non-clickable page indicator)
    - `BreadcrumbEllipsis` (collapsed state indicator)

**Component Props:**
| Component | Props |
|-----------|-------|
| Breadcrumb | `className` |
| BreadcrumbList | `className` |
| BreadcrumbItem | `className` |
| BreadcrumbLink | `className`, `asChild` |
| BreadcrumbPage | `className` |
| BreadcrumbSeparator | `children`, `className` |
| BreadcrumbEllipsis | `className` |

**Key Features:**
- Custom separator support
- Dropdown menu integration capability
- RTL support
- Custom link component support via `asChild` prop

