# 6. yamlToForm.ts process parsing: each binary becomes a SEPARATE ProcessRule {binaries:[bin]}
#    vs formToYaml expects all binaries in ONE combined rule → round-trip is lossy
#    Actually looking again: allBinaries = (input.process ?? []).flatMap((r) => r.binaries)
#    So multiple ProcessRules all get merged into allBinaries → one kprobe. OK.
#    But yamlToForm pushes one ProcessRule per binary → result.process = [{binaries:['a']},{binaries:['b']}]
