// But min={1} set on input, so HTML validation would reject 0 in theory, but React
// doesn't enforce min/max on controlled inputs by default.
// The real issue: port '0' passes filter(Boolean) and gets submitted to YAML.
// This is a minor issue.

// More significant: what about the PolicyEditPage action detection on YAML→form switch?
