Look for:
1. builder.go: netSelectors variable declared but then re-used — is there a shadowing or double-append issue?
2. store.go GetMode: now returns globalMode directly. But globalMode resets on pod restart to "Monitoring". If all policies are actually in Sigkill mode, the displayed mode will say Monitoring even though policies are Protect. Is this a data consistency bug?
