7. discovery.go handlers: getDiscoveryProfiles returns `profiles` which could be nil slice — does json.Encode render nil slice as null or []?
8. store.go: globalMode is not protected by a mutex — SetMode writes and GetMode reads could race in concurrent HTTP requests.

