  "tool_input": {
    "command": "git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
feat: add Behavior Discovery, server-side event storage, and Security Events improvements

Backend:
- Behavior Discovery: pure in-memory profile store (process_exec via Tetragon base sensor,
  no TracingPolicy required), background loop independent of browser SSE connection
- runc_resolver: resolve container ID from runc args to pod/namespace via K8s API (double-checked locking)
- tetragon.go: handle process_exec events for Discovery; parent pod context fallback for kprobe events
- store.go: globalMode with sync.RWMutex; SetMode applies policies before updating cache;
  GetPodLabels API for pod label lookup (filters noisy auto-generated labels)
- policy/builder.go: validate NetworkMode to prevent silent semantic fallback
- SSE events.go: stream all event types to browser

Frontend:
- Security Events: filter to only named-policy kprobe events; expandable detail rows;
  RuleTypeBadge (File/Network/Process); stable eventKey excludes time to survive dedup updates
- Behavior Discovery page: namespace filter dropdown; Create Policy pre-fills name, namespace,
  pod selector, and process rules (each binary as separate rule); concurrent fetch race fix
- PolicyEditPage: read prefill from navigation state; clear history state after consuming
- PolicyForm: FileSection/NetworkSection use FileRule/NetworkRule directly
- Global font size increased to 110%; relative time shows minutes only (no seconds)
- Various bug fixes from three-pass code review

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
EOF
)"",
    "description": "Create git commit"
  }
}

