feat: Behavior Discovery workload grouping (Deployment/DaemonSet/StatefulSet)

Backend:
- PodProfile gains workloadKind/workloadName fields
- After tetra dump seeding, batch-resolve pod owner references in 2 API
  calls (list ReplicaSets + list pods) to populate workload info
- ReplicaSet owners are resolved one level up to the Deployment

Frontend:
- DiscoveryPage defaults to "Grouped by Workload" view
- Toggle button switches between workload groups and individual pods
- Workload card shows kind badge, workload name, pod count, merged binaries
- Create Policy from a workload group uses stable labels (not pod-specific
  hash labels) so the policy survives pod restarts and scaling

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
EOF
)"",
    "description": "Commit workload grouping feature"
  }
}

