    "command": "git add internal/k8s/discovery_store.go internal/k8s/event_bus.go && git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
fix: prune terminated pod profiles in Discovery every 60s

When a Deployment is scaled down, deleted pods kept their profiles in the
in-memory store, causing the pod count to stay inflated.

populateWorkloadInfo (runs every 60s) now builds a set of currently running
pods and calls PruneTerminated to remove profiles for pods no longer in the
Running phase.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
EOF
)"",
