feat: persist custom Policy Templates on pod filesystem

Templates stored at /data/sentinel/templates.json (configurable via
SENTINEL_TEMPLATES_FILE env var). Atomic write (tmp+rename) prevents
corruption. Directory is created if it doesn't exist, making it easy
to mount a PersistentVolume at /data/sentinel for durable storage.

API: GET/POST /api/templates, DELETE /api/templates/{id}
Frontend: replaced localStorage with API calls.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
EOF
)"",
