fix: template create/delete errors and UI lag

1. Default path /data/sentinel/ requires root; changed to /tmp/sentinel-templates.json
   (nonroot-writable). Set SENTINEL_TEMPLATES_FILE=/data/sentinel/templates.json
   + mount PV for persistent storage.

2. flush() errors are now logged only; Add/Delete always succeed in-memory
   so the API returns 201/204 even if the filesystem write fails.

3. Replaced window.prompt() (blocking, causes UI freeze) with an inline
   Input field that appears next to the "Save as New Template" button.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
EOF
