- internal/handler/auth.go: login/logout/me + users CRUD (admin only)
- All /api/* routes protected by auth middleware (cookie-based JWT)
- Bootstrap creates admin/admin if no users exist (logged as WARNING)

Frontend:
- LoginPage: username/password form, shown when not authenticated
- AuthContext: app-wide auth state, calls /api/auth/me on load
- UsersPage: list/create/delete users, change password (admin only)
- AppHeader: shows current username + Sign out button
- AppSidebar: Settings > Users link visible to admin only

Storage: /data/sentinel/users.json and .jwt-secret (same PV as templates)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
EOF
